	(text "SYSTEM — what runs between the blocks" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left)) (uuid "50eeee66-b877-533f-8402-d027bfaabf9c"))
	(text "PACK to TAKEOFF: 160-233.6 VDC, 0.71 A worst, inches of cable, F_HV 2 A DC-rated to 1000 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "2629c7d6-479d-5172-ad4c-a9de306c610d"))
	(text "TAKEOFF to each POST: 24 V regulated, 2.02 A nominal / 2.43 A at the 20 V design floor, 14 AWG buried 60 ft, F_P{1,2} 5 A blade (32 V rated — legal on THIS side only)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "f0cd2828-81e3-56e5-aa2a-30cc973373cd"))
	(text "POST BASE to its 4 DISCS: ONE cable of 7 conductors (+24V, GND, DATA, W_PWM_A, W_PWM_B, SDA, SCL); the discs daisy-chain — a chain has one input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "88fb719c-6749-57a0-b69f-62a06dcc78d5"))
	(text "WHOLE SYSTEM: 2 posts x 4 discs = 8 orb discs, 97.1 W flat out, 4.05 A of the converter's 6.5 A (62%)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 168.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "bb04c8c5-80dd-5be8-96a4-e10499934f98"))
	(text "VOLTAGE DOMAINS: pack (lethal, one plate) / 24 V (everything buried and in-post) / 5 V (pixel rail, made per disc) / 3.3 V (ESP32 logic, re-driven to 5 V before it leaves the base)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "0f6ed60b-d2e8-5f74-a716-a6addf9d35cf"))
	(text "CLIMATE: globes must breathe or they fog — vent + weep + coating are the defences, a humidity sensor per post proves they work (orb_climate.py)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "5df4249f-6cc7-5e33-94e2-a087ec3bb483"))
	(text "WHITE: two channels per disc, 2200 K and 3000 K, blended by the two dim lines. Same emitters and same watts as the single channel it replaced." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "ef5199ea-344c-5cfc-8791-7886ffa51163"))
